<title>USA: Superior Supplement shares, range increased.</title>
<headline>Superior Supplement shares, range increased.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Supplements Inc's initial public offering's price range has been increased to $12 from $10, said the underwriter, VTR Capital Inc.</p>
<p>The proposed number of units to be offered has also been increased to 500,000 from 250,000.</p>
<p>Underwriter said the deal is supposed to trade on February 26.</p>
</text>
